# 2.5 physics information (F-16): units from each field's dimensions on the Boundaries page, fields the turbulence model
# doesn't read marked "not used" (pitzDaily is kEpsilon: omega and nuTilda are ignored), and the field's description,
# typical values and the tutorials' initial values in the drawer.
open $SB/ws/pitzDaily
click nav:boundary conditions
wait-until page Boundary
wait 10
assert text m²/s³
assert text not used
screenshot $OUT/field_units.png
# U is on the second page of columns
click bc-next
wait 5
assert text m/s
click bc-prev
wait 5
click bc-head#0
wait 3
# the epsilon column's initial value: units, meaning and typical range in the drawer
click bc-cell#0#0
wait 5
assert text mixing length
wait-until text In the OpenFOAM tutorials timeout 90
screenshot $OUT/field_drawer.png
budget p95 16.7 max 100
